    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conclāmātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		conclamo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a loud shouting</i> or <i>calling of
				many persons together, a shout</i> (rare; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">not in Cic.): universi exercitūs,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 2, 26</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tot milium sub gladio gementium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Clem. 1, 12, 2</span></i>
			; in plur., <i><span class="en">Tac. A. 3,
			2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. H. 4, 1</span></i>.</div>
